ok 1 - no texts
ok 2 - one text with one letter
ok 3 - one text with multiple letters
ok 4 - two texts with one letter
ok 5 - two texts with multiple letters
ok 6 - ignore letter casing
ok 7 - ignore whitespace
ok 8 - ignore punctuation
ok 9 - ignore numbers
ok 10 - Unicode letters
ok 11 - combination of lower- and uppercase letters, punctuation and white space
ok 12 - large texts
ok 13 - many small texts
